@startuml
title HeroAircraft Singleton Pattern

    abstract class HeroAircraft {
        - {static} volatile HeroAircraft instance
        - int shootNum
        - int power
        - int direction
        - int firePower
        - int fireDuration

        + {static} getInstance(): HeroAircraft
        - HeroAircraft(int locationX, int locationY, int speedX, int speedY, int hp)
        + forward(): void
        + shoot(): List<BaseBullet>
        + addFirePower(int firePower): void
        + addFireDuration(int fireDuration): void
        + getFirePower(): int
        + getFireDuration(): int
        + decreaseFireDuration(): void
        + hasFireSupply(): boolean
    }

class List {
}

class BaseBullet {
}



note right of HeroAircraft::getInstance
    **线程安全的单例实现**
    1. 第一次检查避免不必要的同步
    2. synchronized保证线程安全
    3. 第二次检查确保实例唯一性
    4. volatile防止指令重排序
end note

@enduml